# Path-to-owner map. GitHub requires review from the matching owner before merge,
# once branch protection requires it (see docs/review-gate.md for the toggle).
#
# Last matching pattern wins, same as .gitignore. Keep broad defaults first,
# specific overrides after.

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
*       @REPLACE_WITH_DEFAULT_OWNER

# Example sensitive-path overrides - replace or remove per repo:
# /.github/                @REPLACE_WITH_CI_OWNER
# /security/               @REPLACE_WITH_SECURITY_OWNER
